WEBVTT

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.268
"O-Taru"

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:16.580
...I don't believe it!
Marionettes can't GROW"

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.118
The maiden circuit
is a living heart.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.745
Those with hearts
grow on a daily basis.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.323
THAT was a great bath!

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.751
Bloodberry! What do you
think you're wearing?!

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:32.297
And what's wrong with it? It's not like
exposure is going to make 'em disappear.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.367
Right, Otaru?

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:38.427
Hmm?

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:42.499
Bloodberry, Master Otaru
is trying to work!

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.510
807? I just got back
from work myself!

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.515
Oh, at least put
on a pair of pants!

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.885
Can't you keep it down?! What are...

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.939
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:22.509
| was born to be with you.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.886
The moment I awoke...

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:29.979
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.717
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:37.227
I was born to hold you.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.400
Lies and truths...

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.527
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:49.308
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.144
...won't get to me.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.639
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:58.207
...can be ours once again!

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:02.749
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:06.622
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:10.061
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:14.829
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.516
Go for it.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.955
Yo!

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.493
Here goes!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.075
- Whatcha gonna do with that?
- Eat it.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.553
Is it good?

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.089
Nope.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:16.892
Can |I have it?

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:26.163
What's a "Living Thing"?

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:35.573
I'm home!

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:37.412
Oh, good work!

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.417
Guess what, Otaru?

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.885
If you want sweet potatoes,
there's some in the kitchen.

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:47.427
REALLY?

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:53.166
It's not that!

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.365
"Milk"
Okay, here.

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:05.103
It's not that, either!

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:08.975
Okay, spend it wisely.

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:10.675
YAY!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.718
Allowance, allowance!

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.491
It's not that, EITHER!

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:25.659
Keep it down, would you?
What is it already?

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:29.065
Well... Well, you know?

00:04:29.135 --> 00:04:30.660
Today, when I was
in the mountains...

00:04:31.237 --> 00:04:32.727
...the woodcutter found something...

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.608
That's a squirrel!

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:40.803
He gave it to me.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.310
Whatcha gonna do with it, cook it?

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:45.943
I'm not going to cook it,
I'm going to keep it.

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:47.384
You're going to cook it?

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:49.444
KEEP it!

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:51.012
COOK it?

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.990
YES! Let us cook it at once!
By happy chance, I was able...

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:58.861
...to help myself to all the veggies
in season from the garden in back!

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:02.369
Mmm... Squirrel stew...!
| wonder what that tastes like?

00:05:06.973 --> 00:05:10.773
Now, see here, Lime... It's a lot
of work to keep a living thing...

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:14.438
But, I really, really, really,
really, REALLY WANNA KEEP IT!

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:19.415
If you're prepared to look after it...

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:21.010
Yeah! I am, I am!!

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:23.916
You can keep him.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.958
Thank you, Otaru!!

00:05:28.027 --> 00:05:30.962
You should give him a name...

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.029
Squirrely!

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:38.696
Maybe you should give
it a bit more thought.

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:40.865
That's just "squirrel”
with a "Y" on the end.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.533
Oh, yeah. Um...

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:44.508
Um... um...

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.368
Squirrely!

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:49.074
Can't you think of another one?

00:05:53.186 --> 00:05:54.847
Squirrely...

00:05:58.358 --> 00:05:59.917
All right, so he's Squirrely.

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:06.999
Ew. Put it back.

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:09.692
Cherry, Bloodberry"

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:13.002
Look, he's Squirrely!

00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:15.507
- He's so cute! - You gonna cook 'im?
- I'm gonna keep 'im!

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:18.044
But he really needs a better name...

00:06:18.244 --> 00:06:20.941
- If it were up to me...
- But he looks yummy! - I'm KEEPING him!

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:23.675
- ...I would name him "Cascade.” - I get ya! We'll fatten 'im up first!
- No!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.582
- Squirrel curry! Squirrel gratin!
- No! No!

00:06:25.651 --> 00:06:27.551
- Squirrel omelette! Squirrel parfait!
- No! NO!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.884
<i>- Squirrel in miso! Squirrel soup?
- NO" NOW!</i>

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:33.047
SQUIRREL STEW!!

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:36.585
And in the stew, shirataki!

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:41.797
AFTERNOON!

00:06:42.468 --> 00:06:45.062
Here! Lookit, Gemini!
Isn't he cute?

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:49.242
Gemini?

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:52.845
Oh, Lime!

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:56.541
Grampa Gennai!
What's wrong with Gemini?

00:06:57.116 --> 00:06:59.642
She worked a little too hard today.

00:06:59.719 --> 00:07:04.281
Oh, but it's only a blown fuse.
That can be fixed easily enough.

00:07:10.062 --> 00:07:11.928
Good afternoon, Lime.

00:07:11.998 --> 00:07:14.160
Wow, she's better!

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:18.063
Oh, yeah! This is
Squirrely, Gemini!

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:21.703
Good afternoon, Squirrely.

00:07:23.443 --> 00:07:25.912
Are you going to
keep this squirrel?

00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:26.672
Yup!

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:28.612
He sure is a cutey.

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:30.149
Yup!

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:31.951
One thing though, Lime...

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.510
Caught you!

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:38.785
Lime...! If you do that,
you'll hurt him!

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:02.882
Yoop!

00:08:15.461 --> 00:08:18.726
Is this that maiden circuit
growth he was talking about?

00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:21.758
Loving and caring
for living things...

00:08:39.018 --> 00:08:40.679
Who would do such a thing?!

00:08:44.023 --> 00:08:45.513
Squirrely?

00:08:47.727 --> 00:08:50.389
Wh..Who did this??!

00:08:51.364 --> 00:08:54.356
My special travel plans
for just me and Otaru...!

00:09:03.643 --> 00:09:05.111
Squirrely...

00:09:05.177 --> 00:09:06.645
IT WAS YOut!

00:09:38.477 --> 00:09:40.445
What's going on, guys?

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:42.939
Otaru...

00:09:43.015 --> 00:09:44.312
What's wrong, Lime?

00:09:44.383 --> 00:09:47.080
They want me to get
rid of Squirrely...

00:09:47.153 --> 00:09:49.679
Hey, why do you
want her to do that?

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:51.052
Because!

00:09:51.123 --> 00:09:55.492
He ruined each and every one of my
oh-so-precious pictures of you!

00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:58.292
He made a complete shambles
of the plates, the tea cups...

00:09:58.364 --> 00:10:01.026
...the soy sauce bottles...
--everything in the entire kitchen!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.330
He destroyed all of the pamphlets...

00:10:03.402 --> 00:10:06.372
...I had painstakingly collected
to plan out our trip together!

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:07.964
STUPID SQUIRREL"!

00:10:09.175 --> 00:10:10.370
Did he...

00:10:10.443 --> 00:10:13.538
HE DID! Dispose of this
vicious beast at once!!

00:10:13.613 --> 00:10:16.639
I won't, I won't, I won't, I won't!!
He's my friend!!

00:10:16.716 --> 00:10:17.512
Lime...

00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:20.143
He won't be bad anymore...
Will you, Squirrely?

00:10:23.689 --> 00:10:26.852
C'mon, guys... Why don't
we give it a bit longer?

00:10:27.927 --> 00:10:31.420
Lime, you have to look after
Squirrely better from now on.

00:10:31.497 --> 00:10:34.398
I will! I'll look
after him really good!

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:37.437
- See?
- If you say so, Otaru...

00:10:37.503 --> 00:10:41.371
I really appreciate this...
Try to have a big heart, okay?

00:10:59.125 --> 00:11:00.593
Get rid of it.

00:11:03.129 --> 00:11:05.257
GET RID OF IT""

00:11:25.084 --> 00:11:27.052
C'mon! C'mon, boy! Over here!

00:11:28.854 --> 00:11:30.322
Let's get home, son.

00:11:31.057 --> 00:11:33.082
Wait, dad!

00:11:36.162 --> 00:11:38.597
Incidentally... How are the
preparations for the new sabers...

00:11:38.664 --> 00:11:40.598
...the "Orange Blossoms," going?

00:11:40.666 --> 00:11:43.431
They are at 99% completion, m'Lord.

00:11:43.669 --> 00:11:46.764
All we need do now
is wait for an attack.

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:49.340
And Tamasaburo and Baiko?

00:11:49.408 --> 00:11:51.433
They are being taken
care of as well.

00:11:54.747 --> 00:11:57.216
The storm is approaching.

00:11:57.283 --> 00:11:58.751
M'Lord...

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:19.338
Thank you for the food!

00:12:21.173 --> 00:12:22.265
I'm finished!

00:12:22.341 --> 00:12:24.002
Is that enough for you, Lime?

00:12:24.076 --> 00:12:25.544
Yup!

00:12:27.113 --> 00:12:30.048
<i>Where's she rushing off to?</i>

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:31.345
Who knows?

00:12:31.417 --> 00:12:33.181
She probably went off to play.

00:12:41.227 --> 00:12:44.060
C'mon, Squirrely.
I got food! See?

00:12:48.234 --> 00:12:49.702
Hello?

00:12:50.336 --> 00:12:51.826
Hello??

00:12:54.206 --> 00:12:56.265
Squirrely, what's wrong?

00:12:56.776 --> 00:12:58.244
Squirrely!

00:12:59.011 --> 00:13:01.309
I thought that maybe |
was too harsh with her.

00:13:02.882 --> 00:13:04.509
That's a tough one...

00:13:09.555 --> 00:13:13.150
Squirrely stopped moving!
| think he's broken!

00:13:13.225 --> 00:13:14.693
Lime, what on earth...?

00:13:16.529 --> 00:13:18.930
Will you fix him for me,
Grampa Gennai?

00:13:18.998 --> 00:13:22.832
You can repair him if you get some
new parts, like with that fuse, right?

00:13:25.538 --> 00:13:27.529
He's not broken, Lime.

00:13:29.875 --> 00:13:32.071
He's dead.

00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:35.205
Dead? What do you mean?

00:13:35.581 --> 00:13:37.015
Lime...

00:13:37.082 --> 00:13:40.211
Once living things die,
you can't repair them.

00:13:40.619 --> 00:13:42.451
You're kidding...

00:13:42.521 --> 00:13:44.990
Living things
aren't like marionettes.

00:13:45.057 --> 00:13:48.789
Living things have something
called a "life span,” and...

00:13:49.395 --> 00:13:51.625
...they all have to die sometime.

00:13:56.936 --> 00:13:58.768
Is it my fault?

00:13:58.838 --> 00:14:00.738
It's nobody's fault.

00:14:00.806 --> 00:14:03.503
It's just the fate of
everything that's alive.

00:14:03.576 --> 00:14:05.101
Squirrely...

00:14:06.212 --> 00:14:09.113
If all living things must die...

00:14:09.181 --> 00:14:10.649
...that means...

00:14:14.186 --> 00:14:16.518
HE MOVED!
| just saw him move!!

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:23.018
He's still alive!

00:14:23.095 --> 00:14:24.426
Really?

00:14:24.496 --> 00:14:26.157
Hurry! We gotta get
him to a doctor!

00:14:40.246 --> 00:14:42.374
"AKAIWA CLINIC"

00:14:45.684 --> 00:14:47.152
No, no!

00:14:47.753 --> 00:14:50.620
We specialize in human beings.
We're not going to treat a squirrel!

00:14:51.223 --> 00:14:53.055
Could you please make an exception?

00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:54.718
Please!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.652
If word got round that the
doctor treated a squirrel...

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.700
...it would harm his reputation!
Be of f with you!

00:15:06.939 --> 00:15:09.567
"Araki Clinic"
Hello! Is anybody there?! Hello?!?

00:15:13.545 --> 00:15:16.071
Please! Please have a look at him!

00:15:23.022 --> 00:15:25.957
I'm not desperate enough for
business to treat a squirrel!

00:15:26.792 --> 00:15:28.419
Don't be an idiot!

00:15:32.998 --> 00:15:35.092
Please, doctor! Please!!

00:15:35.167 --> 00:15:36.635
Please?!

00:15:37.202 --> 00:15:40.035
I'll help him for 1,000,000 ryo...

00:15:42.574 --> 00:15:45.566
Dammit, there's no humanity
left in Japoness!

00:15:45.644 --> 00:15:49.774
Otaru! Squirrely is starting
to feel kind of cold!

00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:52.474
Shit...! What should I do?!

00:15:53.652 --> 00:15:55.381
Hey, you!

00:15:55.454 --> 00:15:57.422
Hey, you there!

00:15:59.191 --> 00:16:00.784
Wait, please!

00:16:01.961 --> 00:16:06.296
The doctor sent me...
...to bring you back!

00:16:07.599 --> 00:16:09.567
You mean,
he'll have a look at him?!

00:16:10.002 --> 00:16:13.632
Yes. When I mentioned you to him...

00:16:13.706 --> 00:16:18.007
...he said, "If I can't save a squirrel,
how can I hope to save a human being?!"

00:16:18.077 --> 00:16:19.602
He was absolutely furious...

00:16:19.678 --> 00:16:22.272
"AKAIWA CLINIC"

00:16:27.553 --> 00:16:29.578
That should do it.

00:16:29.655 --> 00:16:33.353
| took this squirrel's body weight
into account and gave him 1/150th...

00:16:33.425 --> 00:16:37.089
...of a dose of medicine normally used
for a human being with these symptoms.

00:16:37.162 --> 00:16:40.757
Now, all we can do is wait.

00:16:45.637 --> 00:16:48.698
Squirrely... Don't die, Squirrely...

00:16:50.109 --> 00:16:51.599
Don't die...

00:17:30.115 --> 00:17:31.583
Squirrely...?

00:17:32.985 --> 00:17:35.113
Squirrely! Squirrely! Squirrely!

00:17:35.487 --> 00:17:38.047
You're better!! Squirrely!

00:17:38.524 --> 00:17:39.992
That's great!!

00:17:41.994 --> 00:17:43.962
Aren't you glad, Squirrely?!

00:17:54.606 --> 00:17:56.700
You sure about this, Lime?

00:17:58.043 --> 00:18:01.138
Yup. Remember what the doctor said?

00:18:01.213 --> 00:18:04.740
"He probably got sick because he
changed environments too quickly."

00:18:07.519 --> 00:18:10.819
I don't want him to get sick again.

00:18:11.557 --> 00:18:13.321
Lime...

00:18:13.559 --> 00:18:16.187
I love the mountains...

00:18:17.129 --> 00:18:20.155
No, I love the sea...
I love the mountains AND the sea...

00:18:26.538 --> 00:18:28.006
Heave-ho!

00:18:29.007 --> 00:18:32.500
I love the OW, and the OW,
not to mention the OW!

00:18:39.251 --> 00:18:41.515
Well, bye-bye, Squirrely.

00:18:50.629 --> 00:18:52.461
Take care.

00:18:58.237 --> 00:18:59.705
Squirrely!

00:19:01.173 --> 00:19:02.732
You can't do that.

00:19:02.808 --> 00:19:07.177
You have to go live in the forest.
I'm sorry I took you away.

00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:09.615
Alley-oop!

00:19:18.223 --> 00:19:20.191
Hey... You stop that.

00:19:24.329 --> 00:19:25.819
Take that!

00:19:50.122 --> 00:19:52.853
Goodbye, Squirrely.

00:19:55.394 --> 00:19:59.331
Goodbye!!

00:20:05.204 --> 00:20:06.672
I'm proud of you, Lime.

00:20:08.941 --> 00:20:10.431
Otaru...

00:20:17.115 --> 00:20:18.605
What's this?

00:20:19.518 --> 00:20:22.613
Water came out of my eye.
Am I broken?

00:20:22.688 --> 00:20:25.020
Lime, do you love Squirrely?

00:20:25.757 --> 00:20:27.168
Yes.

00:20:27.192 --> 00:20:29.661
Do you want the best for him?

00:20:29.728 --> 00:20:31.196
Yes.

00:20:34.199 --> 00:20:36.463
Don't forget that feeling.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:44.131
Otaru...!

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.312
All living things must die...

00:20:55.754 --> 00:20:58.052
It's just the fate of
everything that's alive.

00:21:04.563 --> 00:21:06.725
| see... Did she, now?

00:21:06.865 --> 00:21:12.099
That is something to celebrate...
The revival is almost at hand!

00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:15.172
It's been so long...

00:21:15.774 --> 00:21:17.264
Yes, it has.

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:21.502
| am a beast of a man.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.048
Shogun...

00:21:24.082 --> 00:21:26.449
Let us have faith in them.

00:21:26.518 --> 00:21:30.148
The faith that they will pave
the way for a new generation.

00:22:14.633 --> 00:22:18.228
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:18.437 --> 00:22:22.101
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:25.141
Just think of me...

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:29.738
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:29.981 --> 00:22:33.747
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:33.819 --> 00:22:37.483
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:37.656 --> 00:22:41.422
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:41.493 --> 00:22:43.188
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:43.261 --> 00:22:47.220
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:49.334 --> 00:22:51.666
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:51.737 --> 00:22:56.698
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:56.908 --> 00:23:00.503
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:23:00.712 --> 00:23:04.342
...one step at a time.

00:23:04.583 --> 00:23:08.247
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:12.052
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:12.224 --> 00:23:15.785
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:16.161 --> 00:23:22.123
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:32.077 --> 00:23:33.511
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:33.578 --> 00:23:35.945
Tell me, Otaru... Why do
you think the saber dolls...

00:23:36.014 --> 00:23:39.040
...decided to work for
a bad guy like Faust?

00:23:39.117 --> 00:23:42.644
Oh, well! Today I'm bringing
Cherry's homemade jam rice cakes...

